WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:14.943
glared at Zann and the others.

2
00:00:14.963 --> 00:00:19.704
"I thought I'd seen the last of you when I left Magica."

3
00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:23.386
"We weren't looking for you, Wyssa," Perda said.

4
00:00:23.406 --> 00:00:25.626
"This brought us here."

5
00:00:26.586 --> 00:00:29.367
Wyssa's eyes widened when Perda held up the ring.

6
00:00:30.187 --> 00:00:31.648
The old woman snatched it away.

7
00:00:32.428 --> 00:00:35.631
"This belonged to my sister," she blurted out.

8
00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:42.657
"She gave it to me as a last gift just before Her voice trailed off, and her eyes

9
00:00:42.797 --> 00:00:45.279
narrowed. "Where did you get this?"

10
00:00:45.299 --> 00:00:48.061
"The ring is yours?"

11
00:00:48.602 --> 00:00:49.182
Saffa said.

12
00:00:49.202 --> 00:00:51.384
"We thought it belonged to Morb."

13
00:00:51.404 --> 00:00:55.648
"Ah." Wyssa's expression shifted into a frown.

14
00:00:56.632 --> 00:01:00.615
"I should have known that dirty rat was the one who stole it from me.

15
00:01:01.236 --> 00:01:04.499
He probably planned to use it to blackmail me."

16
00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:07.321
"Oh dear," Saffa said.

17
00:01:07.341 --> 00:01:11.925
"If Morb stole the ring from you, it never really belonged to him."

18
00:01:12.645 --> 00:01:14.987
Zann nodded as he figured out what had happened.

19
00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:18.030
"So the Tracking spell worked," he said.

20
00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:22.653
"But it led us to the ring's true owner, not its most recent possessor."

21
00:01:22.673 --> 00:01:25.736
"That makes sense," Perda said.

22
00:01:26.364 --> 00:01:29.967
"Otherwise it would have led us to Teplo, because he had it last."

23
00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:32.208
Wyssa held up a hand.

24
00:01:32.228 --> 00:01:34.230
"Silence," she said.

25
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.171
"What's going on here?

26
00:01:36.932 --> 00:01:38.913
Why are you tracking Morb?

27
00:01:39.733 --> 00:01:43.316
I told you I'd make sure he never bothers Magica again."

28
00:01:44.197 --> 00:01:47.639
Zann bit his lip and flashed a guilty look at his friends.

29
00:01:47.659 --> 00:01:50.481
"Actually, Morb seems to have a new plan."

30
00:01:51.522 --> 00:01:56.441
After he and his friends told Wyssa everything that had happened, the old woman looked furious.

31
00:01:57.202 --> 00:02:01.786
Wyssa whirled away, muttering under her breath, and stomped over to a nearby bush.

32
00:02:02.526 --> 00:02:04.648
She began plucking berries from its branches.

33
00:02:04.968 --> 00:02:06.009
"What are you doing?"

34
00:02:06.449 --> 00:02:07.170
Saffa asked.

35
00:02:08.331 --> 00:02:10.813
Instead of answering, Wyssa pointed at Zann.

36
00:02:10.833 --> 00:02:13.215
"You, boy," she ordered.

37
00:02:13.235 --> 00:02:17.398
"Go up the lung tree, the one over there with the gray bark.

38
00:02:18.179 --> 00:02:20.701
Break off three twigs from near the top.

39
00:02:21.321 --> 00:02:24.604
Make sure they're small ones, so the tree isn't hurt."

40
00:02:25.588 --> 00:02:26.549
"That's a lung tree?"

41
00:02:27.109 --> 00:02:31.972
Zann remembered his parents saying that they'd used a piece of wood from a lung tree to power

42
00:02:32.032 --> 00:02:32.912
the infusinator.

43
00:02:32.932 --> 00:02:35.754
"Hurry!" Wyssa shouted.

44
00:02:37.074 --> 00:02:39.095
Zann levitated to the top of the tree.

45
00:02:39.736 --> 00:02:44.598
The air sparked around him, magic energy bouncing off him in ticklish little bursts.

46
00:02:45.419 --> 00:02:50.281
He remembered his parents saying that Atmo's magical energy came from the air.

47
00:02:51.222 --> 00:02:55.084
It felt very strange to be surrounded by that much magic all the time!

48
00:02:56.268 --> 00:03:00.650
When he reached the top of the tree, he broke off the twigs, as Wyssa had requested.

49
00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.431
Far below he could hear her barking orders at the others.

50
00:03:05.492 --> 00:03:08.273
Zann glanced down to make sure she wasn't looking up.

51
00:03:09.033 --> 00:03:13.255
Then he broke off another few twigs, which he stuck in his pocket.

52
00:03:14.395 --> 00:03:18.997
Maybe they would help his parents with their experiments, if things ever went back to normal.

53
00:03:19.017 --> 00:03:21.158
"Hurry up, boy!"

54
00:03:21.598 --> 00:03:22.258
Wyssa shouted.

55
00:03:22.278 --> 00:03:24.599
"What's taking you so long?"

56
00:03:24.619 --> 00:03:28.214
"Coming!" he called quickly and floated back down.

57
00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.217
When he reached the ground, Zann saw Wyssa scowl.

58
00:03:33.158 --> 00:03:36.040
She grabbed the twigs out of his hand without saying thank you.

59
00:03:36.741 --> 00:03:37.962
But Zann didn't mind.

60
00:03:38.622 --> 00:03:42.265
He was glad that they'd found her, even if it had been an accident.

61
00:03:42.886 --> 00:03:47.809
She might be the only person who could help them find and defeat Morb for good.

62
00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.973
Wyssa was crouching down by the pile of stuff she'd been gathering.

63
00:03:52.733 --> 00:03:54.315
Saffa wandered over to look.

64
00:03:54.335 --> 00:03:56.648
"Aha!" she exclaimed.

65
00:03:56.668 --> 00:03:59.829
"I just figured out what you're doing, Wyssa.

66
00:04:00.369 --> 00:04:02.410
It's a Locator spell, isn't it?

67
00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.391
A much more sophisticated one than the one we used though."

68
00:04:07.512 --> 00:04:08.712
Wyssa didn't respond.

69
00:04:09.772 --> 00:04:15.214
She was assembling the twigs Zann had brought her into a tepee shape, tying them together with some

70
00:04:15.294 --> 00:04:16.354
vines she'd gathered.

71
00:04:16.374 --> 00:04:20.856
"Are you building a contraption like the Secret Eye?"

72
00:04:21.136 --> 00:04:21.776
Perda asked.

73
00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.781
"Or like those things Morb is always building?"

74
00:04:26.281 --> 00:04:27.561
Gliss asked uneasily.

75
00:04:27.581 --> 00:04:32.243
"It does look like Morb's contraptions, only smaller," Zann agreed.

76
00:04:32.263 --> 00:04:34.643
"Where did you learn how to make it?"

77
00:04:35.424 --> 00:04:36.484
Wyssa glanced up.

78
00:04:36.504 --> 00:04:40.245
"I need to concentrate," she growled.

79
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.526
"Stop your incessant chattering."

80
00:04:44.566 --> 00:04:47.487
The group fell silent while Wyssa continued her work.

81
00:04:48.547 --> 00:04:51.308
Soon the little contraption resembled a pyramid.

82
00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.761
It was filled with various leaves and stones.

83
00:04:55.721 --> 00:04:58.062
Green berry juice ran down its sides.

84
00:04:58.782 --> 00:05:01.863
Finally Wyssa tied the glowing ring onto it.

85
00:05:01.883 --> 00:05:04.624
"The ring is part of the magic?"

86
00:05:05.044 --> 00:05:06.484
Saffa asked with interest.

87
00:05:06.964 --> 00:05:09.985
"Will it help you locate Morb because he stole it from you?"

88
00:05:11.586 --> 00:05:14.206
Zann expected Wyssa to ignore that question too.

89
00:05:15.067 --> 00:05:16.427
But she glanced up at Saffa.

90
00:05:17.287 --> 00:05:19.068
"No," Wyssa said firmly.

91
00:05:20.016 --> 00:05:22.397
"I didn't attach the ring because of Morb.

92
00:05:22.957 --> 00:05:25.878
This ring has been in my family for generations.

93
00:05:26.379 --> 00:05:31.521
That gives me a special connection with it, which will boost the spell's magic power."

94
00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:34.042
"Cool," Perda said.

95
00:05:34.062 --> 00:05:36.443
"I've read about that kind of thing.

96
00:05:37.123 --> 00:05:38.784
It's sort of like using a relic."

97
00:05:39.904 --> 00:05:41.345
"Silence, please."

98
00:05:42.165 --> 00:05:45.907
Wyssa sprinkled a handful of sparkly powder over the contraption.

99
00:05:45.927 --> 00:05:49.148
"Morb!" she intoned loudly.

100
00:05:49.976 --> 00:05:51.457
"Show us Morb!"

101
00:05:52.657 --> 00:05:57.699
Zann held his breath as a puff of pale green smoke emerged from the contraption.

102
00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:04.282
It slowly formed into a ghostly image of Morb.

103
00:06:04.302 --> 00:06:06.103
"It's him!"

104
00:06:06.543 --> 00:06:07.283
Saffa cried.

105
00:06:08.564 --> 00:06:09.964
Zann stared at the image.

106
00:06:11.325 --> 00:06:16.107
It showed Morb standing in a sandy landscape with a jagged ridge behind him.

107
00:06:17.227 --> 00:06:19.288
He was scowling at something Zann couldn't see.

108
00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:23.042
A second later a gust of wind blew the image away.

109
00:06:23.062 --> 00:06:26.184
"Aah!" Gliss cried in frustration.

110
00:06:26.204 --> 00:06:29.466
"We didn't see enough to know where he is!"

111
00:06:29.486 --> 00:06:32.268
"Yeah," Zann said.

112
00:06:32.288 --> 00:06:35.309
"There must be lots of desert worlds out there."

113
00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.911
Wyssa's eyes met Saffa's.

114
00:06:37.931 --> 00:06:42.574
"I know exactly where that is," Wyssa said.

115
00:06:43.895 --> 00:06:45.616
Saffa was nodding slowly.

116
00:06:46.908 --> 00:06:50.212
"I recognized Dragonjaw Ridge in the background.

117
00:06:50.792 --> 00:06:54.456
It's one of the most recognizable features in the Far Frontier."

118
00:06:54.476 --> 00:06:57.119
"The Far Frontier?"

119
00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:58.901
Zann said with a gasp.

120
00:07:00.543 --> 00:07:04.187
"But that means "Yes," Saffa said grimly.

121
00:07:04.207 --> 00:07:07.250
"Morb is already back in Magica."
